## Methodology

Conclusions are derived from the Maximum Expected Epistemic Value (MEEV) scoring
function applied to each stream. The composite score weights:

- **Impact:** {{ "%.2f"|format(weights.w_impact) }}
- **Freshness:** {{ "%.2f"|format(weights.w_freshness) }}
- **Reliability (confidence):** {{ "%.2f"|format(weights.w_reliability) }}
- **Corroboration:** {{ "%.2f"|format(weights.w_corroboration) }}

Authority tier weights multiply the composite score and are fixed per version;
stream confidence cannot override tier weight.
